  "risks": [
    "The producer still retains full public wire streams and the wrapper still enforces the same 64 MiB public audit-input limit. R7 can fail on the same budget before producing a usable public result.",
    "The owner-2 arrival trigger is easier to satisfy than R6's two-owner, two-actor trigger, but it does not guarantee a qualifying 400-tick public window or native capture.",
